    "issue_alignment": "The MQTT CONNECT_ACK decoder (MqttDecode_ConnectAck) fails to initialize the properties pointer (connect_ack->props) before optional property parsing; a reused connection acknowledgment retains a stale (already freed) props pointer when props_len == 0, and the stale pointer is passed to the property cleanup routine (MqttProps_Free via Handle_Props), causing a write to an invalid memory location. The upstream fix (v1.17.1, 'Fix Wild read in MqttProps_Free') adds connect_ack->props = NULL."
